  {
   "shot": "S15",
   "a": 1046,
   "b": 1356,
   "t0": 0,
   "t1": 310,
   "line": "And is any of this real? The rules are. No cell network until 1979. No GPS until 1978. No penicillin until 1928. A hundred years ago, a computer was a person with a pencil."
